Revision history for Bioconda-Packages

2026.11.4  2026-11-24
      - Database update: rebuilt from bioconda-recipes 732e36fd.

0.1.0 2026-11-25
      - Upgraded pipelines
      - Semantic version

0.01  2026-11-24
      - Initial release.
      - Offline, read-only query API (Bioconda::Packages) over a bundled,
        gzipped JSON snapshot of Bioconda package metadata.
      - Jinja-aware, core-only meta.yaml parser (Bioconda::Packages::RecipeParser).
      - Maintainer tooling to rebuild the database from a bioconda-recipes clone,
        with optional anaconda.org enrichment (Bioconda::Packages::Updater,
        maintainer/update-db.pl).
      - Removed packages are retained and flagged (is_removed / removed_at).
      - Command-line client: bin/bioconda-packages, incl. a 'version' command
        (also --version/-V) reporting the tool and database versions.
      - Progressive database version string (CalVer YEAR.MONTH.N, SemVer-sortable)
        stamped into the db meta and exposed via db_version()/stats(). The
        version bumps - and the db file is rewritten - only when the semantic
        content changes (tracked by a content hash that ignores timestamps and
        download counts); update-db.pl --force overrides this.
